OL,3,GNEWSAHouse builders' community cash
OL,4,Apaid up to 10 years late
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has admitted there were
OL,7,F"systematic failings" with the
OL,8,Fmonitoring of payments that were due to
OL,9,Fbe given to it by housing developers
OL,10,Fthat were intended to fund community
OL,11,Ffacilities.
OL,13,FLuton Borough Council has clawed back
OL,14,F#4.2m of the money that should have
OL,15,Fpaid between 2010 and 2021.
OL,17,FThe agreements are supposed to pay for
OL,18,Fthings like roads, schools and health
OL,19,Fcentres to offset the effects of new
OL,20,Fhousing or other types of property.
